// ── observer-fx.js ───────────────────────────────────────────────
// The LCD's comic cut-ins and amber-terminal madness, on the TV.
//
// This is ui-fx.hpp ported to the browser, and it is meant to stay a port:
// the same hash, the same noise, the same halftone screen, the same distance-
// field SFX lettering built from the same LovyanGFX glyphs (embedded below by
// scripts/gen_observer_fx_fonts.py), the same cue catalogue and timings. When
