// death. What it cannot see -- the quake, the strike, the Doom -- the firmware
// now publishes: /state carries `fx`, a ring of the panels the LCD itself cut
// in (fxCueLogJson in ui-fx.hpp), and `doom` for the eyes. When the ring is
// there it is the whole truth and local derivation stands down, so the TV and
// the LCD cut in on exactly the same beats.
//
//   ?fx=0|1|2     off / restrained / madness (default 2)
//   ?fx=reel      play every panel in turn, for tuning on the TV itself
//   ?fxmad=0-255  pin the madness level
